% SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
% =====================================================================
% parameters.clausal -- the PROVENANCE records of the sourced figures of
% eu/dora_register_of_information. PROVENANCE ONLY: this file references each figure by
% name and holds no value, and the logic modules do not import it.
%
% If parameters-sources.yaml is the COMMISSIONING REGISTER (its first line
% says so), then for EACH of its keys:
%   1. the VALUE is a fact in the determination slice that READS it
%      (that slice's .clausal file), never here;
%   2. this file holds its provenance record, a fact:
%        parameter_source(<key>, [label-'...', ref-'...', verbatim-'...']).
%      with the verbatim pair OMITTED while the yaml entry is
%      `status: unverified`.
% Otherwise this file holds no records at the baseline.
%
% This order reads NO statutory figure: no threshold, period, amount or date.
% 'At least yearly' (DORA Art 28(3), third subparagraph) is part of the caller's
% judgement on reported_to_competent_authorities_at_least_yearly (reading (10));
% the rank 'higher or equal to 1' (ITS Article 2) is part of the caller's
% judgement on rank_assigned_to_each_ict_third_party_service_provider (reading
% (16)); the date of application of DORA and the entry into force of the ITS are
% not read (reading (18)). So this file holds no records and is kept for layout.
% =====================================================================

:- module(parameters, []).

:- end_module(parameters).
